  4.0021890899504337`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc2e7e63-b82a-4b4e-9a91-\
87a752a47e60"],

Cell["\<\
Since the population risk difference under the null hypothesis is NOT in this \
interval, we reject the null hypothesis and support the alternative hypothesis\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0021890569154863`*^9, 4.002189091430017*^9}, {
  4.0021891333*^9, 
  4.002189192068952*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33445c5d-0ac8-4827-a703-\
