  4.002380904576103*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"02047d4f-f416-4957-84f3-\
ee66b6658d52"],

Cell["\<\
Relative risk and risk difference is only for cross-sectional and cohort \
studies\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0022070649721727`*^9, 4.0022071283980923`*^9}, {
   4.002380764470153*^9, 4.002380801039439*^9}, 
