Cell["\<\
The test statistic is in the region of rejection and we reject the null \
hypothesis and support the alternative hypothesis\
\>", "Subsubitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002208853918499*^9, 4.0022088644882097`*^9}, {
  4.002208937795302*^9, 4.002208967473832*^9}, {4.0022090556952343`*^9, 
